# ── Default-deny whitelist — hanya artefak publik yang ter-track ──
# Filosofi: tolak SEMUA dulu, izinkan eksplisit. File instruktur/rahasia
# (soal, rubrik, demo-script, runbook, rehearsal) tak pernah masuk git.
# GitHub Pages meng-serve repo ini di <user>.github.io/<repo>/

# sampah — selalu tolak
**/.DS_Store

# tolak semua di root repo
/*

# izinkan tooling + landing
!.gitignore
!.nojekyll
!index.html

# ── roe: deck Rule of Engagement (pra-sesi, publik) ──
!roe/
roe/*
!roe/slides/
roe/slides/*
!roe/slides/index.html
!roe/slides/img/

# ── deck slide per minggu: w01 + w02 + w03 + w04 + w05 publik ──
# Aturan sejak 2026-07-29: yang dipublikasikan HANYA folder slides/ dan assets/.
# SELURUH dokumen .md milik minggu (exercise · handout · panduan-peserta ·
# troubleshooting · slides-outline · runbook · penjelasan) → LOCAL, tanpa kecuali.
# (w06–w08 sengaja TIDAK di-whitelist → LOCAL.)
!w01/
!w02/
!w03/
!w04/
!w05/
w0*/*
!w01/slides/
!w02/slides/
!w03/slides/

# w04: deck persiapan H-1 (tool·database·skill) + deck Battle #1 (dibuka H-0)
!w04/slides-prebattle/
w04/slides-prebattle/*
!w04/slides-prebattle/index.html
!w04/slides/
w04/slides/*
!w04/slides/index.html

# w03: hanya deck final — arsip & backup TIDAK ikut publik
w03/slides/*
!w03/slides/index.html

# w05: hanya deck final (Season 2 · Minggu 1 · Arsenal MCP)
!w05/slides/
w05/slides/*
!w05/slides/index.html

# ── assets: hanya berkas yang benar-benar dipakai peserta ──
!w01/assets/
w01/assets/*
!w01/assets/project-definition.json
!w02/assets/
w02/assets/*
!w02/assets/setup-check.sh

# ── penolakan terakhir: nol .md di seluruh deck mingguan ──
# Sengaja ditaruh paling bawah supaya menang atas whitelist folder slides/ di atas
# (mis. w01/slides/bukti/README.md — catatan build deck, bukan materi peserta).
w0*/**/*.md

# ── _shared: hanya dokumen peserta (bukan doc build-internal) ──
!_shared/
_shared/*
!_shared/persiapan-peserta.md
!_shared/versions.md
!_shared/CLAUDE.md
# stage-setup.md + bootstrap-stage.sh → LOCAL (materi pemateri, TAK di-publish)
!_shared/templates/
# seed/ (dipakai grademe, bukan materi sesi) · build-week-handson.md · deck-engine.md → LOCAL (tak di-whitelist)
